// The startImport server resolver calls input.searchReplace.filter(...) and
// expects urlHeaders to be present, so empty arrays must be sent as [] rather
// than omitted. Disable genqlient's default omitempty on these list fields to
// match the Node CLI (which always sends searchReplace: []). The $input variable
